due in the reserve tranche. To maintain comparability between data on transactions with the IMF and data on long-term debt, use of IMF credit outstanding at the end of year (stock) is converted to dollars at the SDR exchange rate in effect at the end of year. Repurchases (flows) are converted at the average SDR exchange rate for the year in which transactions take place. Data are in current U.S. dollars.','',81,20),(1104,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.03.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 0 to 3, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1105,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.0912.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 9 to 12, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1106,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.1218.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 12 to 18, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1107,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.1824.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 18 to 24, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1108,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.24P.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 2yrs, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1109,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.36.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 3 to 6, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1110,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.69.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, More than 6 to 9, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1111,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.CB.AR.IQ.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, Immediate, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1112,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.GG.AR.03.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, General Government, More than 0 to 3, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1113,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.GG.AR.0912.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, General Government, More than 9 to 12, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1114,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.GG.AR.1218.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pmt, General Government, More than 12 to 18, Loans, Principal, USD','','',22,3),(1115,'DT.AMT.DLTL.CD.GG.AR.1824.US','Gross Ext. Debt