ilities, USD','','',23,3),(2254,'DT.DOD.PUOT.CD.LT.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Other creditors, Long-term, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2255,'DT.DOD.PUOT.CD.ST.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Other creditors, Short-term, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2256,'DT.DOD.PUOT.CD.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Other creditors, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2257,'DT.DOD.PUST.CD.PU.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Public Sector Ext. Debt, Short-term, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2258,'DT.DOD.PUTC.LT.AR.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Long-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',23,3),(2259,'DT.DOD.PUTC.ST.AR.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Short-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',23,3),(2260,'DT.DOD.PUTD.CD.LT.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Debt securities\' holders, Long-term, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2261,'DT.DOD.PUTD.CD.ST.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Debt securities\' holders, Short-term, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2262,'DT.DOD.PUTD.CD.US','Public Sector Ext. Debt Pos., Debt securities\' holders, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',23,3),(2263,'DT.DOD.PVLT.CD','Present value of debt (US$)','','',57,3),(2264,'DT.DOD.PVLX.CD','Present value of external debt (current US$)','Present value of debt is the sum of short-term external debt plus the discounted sum of total debt service payments due on public, publicly guaranteed, and private nonguaranteed long-term external debt over the life of existing loans. This calculation assumes that the PV of loans with a negative grant element is equal to the nominal value of the loan. Data are in current U.S. dollars.','',2,3),(2265,'DT.DOD.PVLX.EX.ZS','Present value of external debt (% of exports of goods, services and primary income)','Present value of external debt to exports of goods, services and income. Present value of debt is the sum of short-term external debt plus the discounted sum of total debt service payments due on public, publicly guaranteed, and private nonguaranteed long-term external debt over the life of existing loans. This calculation assumes that the PV of loans with a negative grant element is equal to the nominal value of the loan. Exports of goods, services and primary income is the sum of goods (merchandise) exports, exports of (nonfactor) services and income (factor) receipts. The exports denominator is a three-year average.','',2,3),(2266,'DT.DOD.PVLX.GN.ZS','Present value of external debt (% of GNI)','Present value of external debt to gross national income. Present value of debt is the sum of short-term external debt plus the discounted sum of total debt service payments due on public, publicly guaranteed, and private nonguaranteed long-term external debt over the life of existing loans. This calculation assumes that the PV of loans with a negative grant element is equal to the nominal value of the loan. GNI (formerly GNP) is the sum of value added by all resident producers plus any product taxes (less subsidies) not included in the valuation of output plus net receipts of primary income (compensation of employees and property income) from abroad. The GNI denominator is a three-year average.','',2,3),(2267,'DT.DOD.PVLX.ND.ZS','Present value to nominal value of debt (%)','Present value of debt is the sum of short-term external debt plus the discounted sum of total debt service payments due on public, publicly guaranteed, and private nonguaranteed long-term external debt over the life of existing loans.  Total external debt is debt owed to nonresidents repayable in currency, goods, or services. Total external debt is the sum of public, publicly guaranteed, and private nonguaranteed long-term debt, use of IMF credit, and short-term debt. Short-term debt includes all debt having an original maturity of one year or less and interest in arrears on long-term debt. Data are in current U.S. dollars.  ','',11,3),(2268,'DT.DOD.RSDL.CD','Residual, debt stock-flow reconciliation (current US$)','The residual difference, i.e. the change in stock not explained by any of the factors identified under debt stock-flow reconciliation, is calculated as the sum of identified accounts minus the change in stock. Where the latter is large it can, in some cases, serve as an illustration of the inconsistencies in the reported data. More often however, it can be explained by specific borrowing phenomenon in individual countries. Data are in current U.S. dollars.','',81,20),(2269,'DT.DOD.SDLT.CD.PU.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Public Sector Ext. Debt, Long-term, Special drawing rights (allocations), USD','','',22,3),(2270,'DT.DOD.TCLT.CD.PR.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Publicly Guar. Private Sector Ext. Debt, Long-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',22,3),(2271,'DT.DOD.TCLT.CD.PU.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Public Sector Ext. Debt, Long-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',22,3),(2272,'DT.DOD.TCST.CD.PR.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Publicly Guar. Private Sector Ext. Debt, Short-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',22,3),(2273,'DT.DOD.TCST.CD.PU.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., Public Sector Ext. Debt, Short-term, Trade credit and advances, USD','','',22,3),(2274,'DT.DOD.VTOT.CD','External debt stocks, variable rate (DOD, current US$)','Variable interest rate is long-term external debt with interest rates that float with movements in a key market rate; for example, the London interbank offered rate (LIBOR) or the U.S. prime rate. This item conveys information about the borrower\'s exposure to changes in international interest rates. Long-term external debt is defined as debt that has an original or extended maturity of more than one year and that is owed to nonresidents by residents of an economy and repayable in currency, goods, or services. Data are in current U.S. dollars.','',81,20),(2275,'DT.DOR.DECT.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., All Sectors, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2276,'DT.DOR.DECT.CB.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2277,'DT.DOR.DECT.CB.DS.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, All maturities, Debt securities, Memo item, USD','','',22,3),(2278,'DT.DOR.DECT.CD.CB.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Deposit-Taking Corp., exc. CB, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2279,'DT.DOR.DECT.CD.GG.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., General Government, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2280,'DT.DOR.DECT.CD.IL.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., DI: Intercom Lending, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2281,'DT.DOR.DECT.CD.MA.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Central Bank, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2282,'DT.DOR.DECT.CD.OT.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Other Sectors, All maturities, All instruments, USD','','',22,3),(2283,'DT.DOR.DECT.DS.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., All Sectors, All maturities, Debt securities, Memo item, USD','','',22,3),(2284,'DT.DOR.DECT.GG.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., General Government, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2285,'DT.DOR.DECT.GG.DS.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., General Government, All maturities, Debt securities, Memo item, USD','','',22,3),(2286,'DT.DOR.DECT.IL.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., DI: Intercom Lending, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2287,'DT.DOR.DECT.MA.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Central Bank, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2288,'DT.DOR.DECT.MA.DS.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Central Bank, All maturities, Debt securities, Memo item, USD','','',22,3),(2289,'DT.DOR.DECT.OT.AR.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Other Sectors, All maturities, All instruments, Arrears, USD','','',22,3),(2290,'DT.DOR.DECT.OT.DS.US','Gross Ext. Debt Pos., ST Rem., Other Sectors, All maturities,