, life skills, and cash for training), job rotation and job sharing, employment incentives and wage subsidies, supported employment and rehabilitation, and employment measures for the disabled. Estimates include both direct and indirect beneficiaries.','',2,10),(5522,'per_lm_alllm.adq_pop_urb','Adequacy of benefits (%) - All Labor Market -urban','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5523,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q1_preT_tot','Adequacy of benefits in 1st quintile (poorest) (%) - All Labor Market (preT)','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5524,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q1_rur','Adequacy of benefits in 1st quintile (poorest) (%) - All Labor Market -rural','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5525,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q1_tot','Adequacy of benefits in 1st quintile (poorest) (%) - All Labor Market','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5526,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q1_urb','Adequacy of benefits in 1st quintile (poorest) (%) - All Labor Market -urban','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5527,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q2_preT_tot','Adequacy of benefits in 2nd quintile (%) - All Labor Market (preT)','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of beneficiaries in that group','',29,10),(5528,'per_lm_alllm.adq_q2_rur','Adequacy of benefits in 2nd quintile (%) - All Labor Market -rural','Total transfer amount received by all beneficiaries in a population group as a share of the total welfare of